<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>lark <span class='pt-highlight'>about</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：[ABOUT] 非线性闲散口语图式' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>play boisterously</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>frolic, lark</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>The children frolicked in the garden.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>The gamboling lambs in the meadows.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>③</span>The toddlers romped in the playroom.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>muck <span class='pt-highlight'>about</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: putter)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>do random, unplanned work or activities or spend time idly</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>putter, potter</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The old lady is usually <b>mucking</b> <b>about</b> in her little house.</div></div></div></td></tr>
</table></details>
<details class='sub-section' id='sub_1'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>小品词 [ACROSS] 核心短语动词 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'></span></span><span class='sub-meta'>17 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>📖 <b>EPE 认知机制 (Lindstromberg Ch.7 & Ch.9 §5 ACROSS vs OVER/THROUGH)：</b>ACROSS 包含 <i>cross</i>（十字正交），指<b>「在平面上从一侧垂直横渡到对面 (Fig.9.16)」</b>。EPE Ch.9 §5.4 专门剖析了三大短语：① <i>get your point across</i>（把观点横渡过“沟通鸿沟 communication gap”送达对方）；② <i>come/run across</i>（两条路线在十字路口偶然交汇 = 偶遇）；③ <i>cut across class lines</i>（图 9.19：垂直切过并超越多个固有分层界限）。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>across</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>1/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>become clear or enter one's consciousness or emotions</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>click, dawn</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>It dawned on him that she had betrayed him.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>She was penetrated with sorrow.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>across</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>2/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [communicate] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>communicate successfully</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>communicate</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>I couldn't <b>get</b> <b>across</b> the message.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>He put over the idea very well.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>across</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>3/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [traverse] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>travel across or pass over</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>traverse, track</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The caravan covered almost 100 miles each day.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>across</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>go across or through</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>travel, locomote</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>We passed the point where the police car had parked.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>A terrible thought went through his mind.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>come <span class='pt-highlight'>across</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>1/5</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>find unexpectedly</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>strike, attain</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>The archeologists chanced upon an old tomb.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>She struck a goldmine.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>③</span>The hikers finally struck the main path to the lake.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>look <span class='pt-highlight'>across</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [overlook] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>be oriented in a certain direction</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>overlook, lie</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>The house looks out on a tennis court.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>The apartment overlooks the Hudson.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>come <span class='pt-highlight'>across</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>2/5</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [resonate] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>be received or understood</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>resonate</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The situation began to <b>come</b> <b>across</b> unexpectedly.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>come <span class='pt-highlight'>across</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>3/5</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [communicate] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>communicate the intended meaning or impression</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>communicate, intercommunicate</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>He came across very clearly.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>come <span class='pt-highlight'>across</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>4/5</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>come together</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>meet, encounter</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>I'll probably see you at the meeting.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>How nice to see you again!</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>come <span class='pt-highlight'>across</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>5/5</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [appear] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>be perceived in a certain way; make a certain impression</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>appear, seem</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The situation began to <b>come</b> <b>across</b> unexpectedly.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>put <span class='pt-highlight'>across</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [communicate] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>transmit information</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>communicate, convey</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>Please communicate this message to all employees.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>Pass along the good news.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>put <span class='pt-highlight'>one across</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + adv. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>fool or hoax</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>gull, dupe</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>The immigrant was duped because he trusted everyone.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>You can't fool me!</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>run <span class='pt-highlight'>across</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>come together</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>meet, encounter</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>I'll probably see you at the meeting.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>How nice to see you again!</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>cut <span class='pt-highlight'>across</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>1/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [traverse] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>travel across or pass over</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>traverse, track</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The caravan covered almost 100 miles each day.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>cut <span class='pt-highlight'>across</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>2/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: be)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>be contrary to ordinary procedure or limitations</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>be</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>Opinions on bombing the Serbs <b>cut</b> <b>across</b> party lines.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>cut <span class='pt-highlight'>across</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>3/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [crosscut] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>cut using a diagonal line</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>crosscut, cut</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>They decided to <b>cut</b> it <b>across</b> right away.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>pass <span class='pt-highlight'>across</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: transit)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>make a passage or journey from one place to another</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>transit</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>The tourists moved through the town and bought up all the souvenirs;.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>Some travelers pass through the desert.</div></div></div></td></tr>
</table></details>
<details class='sub-section' id='sub_2'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>小品词 [AFTER] 核心短语动词 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'></span></span><span class='sub-meta'>11 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>📖 <b>EPE 认知机制 (Lindstromberg Ch.8 §4.2 & §6 AFTER vs BEHIND)：</b>在空间与时间序列中，AFTER 表示<b>「跟随在运动目标的后方追逐或照看 (Following in sequence or pursuit)」</b>。因此，目光或脚步紧随其后以确保其安全即为照料（<i>look/see/tend after</i>），在后方追赶或索取即为追求与询问（<i>run/chase/go/lust/ask/inquire after</i>），长相性格随长辈之后即为相像（<i>take after</i>）。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>be <span class='pt-highlight'>after</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库学术/公文分布比高 (1.659x)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>have the will and intention to carry out some action</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>plan, intend</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>He plans to be in graduate school next year.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>The rebels had planned turmoil and confusion.</div></div></div></td></tr>
