<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>break <span class='pt-highlight'>apart</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>2/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: crash)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>break violently or noisily; smash</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>crash, disintegrate</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The situation began to <b>break</b> <b>apart</b> unexpectedly.</div></div></div></td></tr>
