<details class='sub-section' id='sub_5'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>小品词 [ASIDE] 核心短语动词 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'></span></span><span class='sub-meta'>9 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>📖 <b>EPE 认知机制 (Lindstromberg Ch.5 §4 ASIDE)：</b>ASIDE 的隐含参照物是<b>「观察者的视线或前进正前方路径 (Line of sight or line of advance)」</b>，将某物移向左右旁侧（`S ← Landmark → S`）：① <b>扫除阻碍或漠视</b>（<i>brush/wave/sweep/shunt/push/cast/step aside</i>）；② <b>拉到一旁私聊或留存备用</b>（<i>take sb aside; set/put/lay money or time aside</i>）。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>set <span class='pt-highlight'>aside</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>1/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [allow] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>give or assign a resource to a particular person or cause</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>allow, appropriate</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>I will earmark this money for your research.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>She <b>sets</b> <b>aside</b> time for meditation every day.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>set <span class='pt-highlight'>aside</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>2/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [suspend] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>make inoperative or stop</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>suspend</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>Suspend payments on the loan.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>put <span class='pt-highlight'>aside</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>1/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [interrupt] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>turn away from and put aside, perhaps temporarily</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>interrupt, disrupt</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>It's time for you to put away childish things.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>put <span class='pt-highlight'>aside</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>2/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>stop using</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>stop</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>The children were told to put away their toys.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>The students put away their notebooks.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>push <span class='pt-highlight'>aside</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>1/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: push)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>push out of the way</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>push, force</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>They decided to <b>push</b> it <b>aside</b> right away.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>cast <span class='pt-highlight'>aside</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库学术/公文分布比高 (1.78x) + 作为正式词 [discard] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>throw or cast away</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>discard, fling</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>Put away your worries.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>push <span class='pt-highlight'>aside</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>2/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [dismiss] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>bar from attention or consideration</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>dismiss, disregard</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>She dismissed his advances.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>lay <span class='pt-highlight'>aside</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>accumulate money for future use</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>save</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>He saves half his salary.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>brush <span class='pt-highlight'>aside</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [dismiss] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>bar from attention or consideration</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>dismiss, disregard</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>She dismissed his advances.</div></div></div></td></tr>
</table></details>
<details class='sub-section' id='sub_6'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>小品词 [BEAR] 核心短语动词 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'></span></span><span class='sub-meta'>1 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>📖 <b>EPE 认知机制：</b>核心小品词空间与隐喻延伸用法。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>bring <span class='pt-highlight'>to bear</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + adv. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [effect] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>bring into operation or effect</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>effect</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The new members brought to bear new concerns to the U.N.</div></div></div></td></tr>
</table></details>
<details class='sub-section' id='sub_7'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>小品词 [BED] 核心短语动词 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'></span></span><span class='sub-meta'>1 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>📖 <b>EPE 认知机制：</b>核心小品词空间与隐喻延伸用法。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>to bed</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + adv. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>prepare for sleep</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>bed, retire</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>I usually turn in at midnight.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>He <b>goes</b> to <b>bed</b> at the crack of dawn.</div></div></div></td></tr>
</table></details>
<details class='sub-section' id='sub_8'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>小品词 [BE] 核心短语动词 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'></span></span><span class='sub-meta'>1 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>📖 <b>EPE 认知机制：</b>核心小品词空间与隐喻延伸用法。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>to be</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + adv. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [repute] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>look on as or consider</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>repute, esteem</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>She looked on this affair as a joke.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>He thinks of himself as a brilliant musician.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>③</span>He is reputed to be intelligent.</div></div></div></td></tr>
</table></details>
<details class='sub-section' id='sub_9'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>小品词 [BROKE] 核心短语动词 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'></span></span><span class='sub-meta'>1 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>📖 <b>EPE 认知机制：</b>核心小品词空间与隐喻延伸用法。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>for broke</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + adv. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [gamble] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>risk everything in one big effort</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>gamble, chance</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The cyclist went for broke at the end of the race.</div></div></div></td></tr>
</table></details>
<details class='sub-section' id='sub_10'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>小品词 [BY] 核心短语动词 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'></span></span><span class='sub-meta'>30 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>📖 <b>EPE 认知机制 (Lindstromberg Ch.10 §2.1 & Ch.11 BY, NEAR, PAST)：</b>BY 兼具静态与动态双重图式：① <b>静态在侧（Nearness to a side）</b>：站在近旁随时待命支持或袖手旁观（<i>stand/sit/stick/abide/swear by</i>），或把钱存放在手边备用（<i>put/lay by</i>）；② <b>动态擦身掠过（Go past — Fig.10.1 right）</b>：沿直线从参照物旁经过，引申为时间流逝、顺道拜访或勉强维持通关（<i>go/pass/fly/roll/drop/stop/get/scrape by</i>）。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>by</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>1/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>come to terms with</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>cope, contend</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>We got by on just a gallon of gas.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>They made do on half a loaf of bread every day.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>by</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>1/4</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [surpass] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>move past</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>surpass, travel</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>A black limousine passed by when she looked out the window.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>He passed his professor in the hall.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>③</span>One line of soldiers surpassed the other.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>by</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>2/4</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [elapse] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>pass by</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>elapse, lapse</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>Three years elapsed.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>do <span class='pt-highlight'>by</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: treat)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>interact in a certain way</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>treat, handle</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span><b>Do</b> right <b>by</b> her.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>Treat him with caution, please.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>③</span>Handle the press reporters gently.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>do <span class='pt-highlight'>well by</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + adv. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: treat)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>treat with respect and consideration</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>treat, handle</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>Children should <b>do</b> well <b>by</b> their parents.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>by</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>2/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [escape] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>escape potentially unpleasant consequences; get away with a forbidden action</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>escape, avoid</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>She gets away with murder!</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>I couldn't get out from under these responsibilities.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>by</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>3/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [overtake] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>pass or move in front of</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>overtake, overhaul</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>Bride's Biscuit got by the other dogs to win the race.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>by</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>3/4</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>be called; go by a certain name</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>be</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>She <b>goes</b> <b>by</b> her maiden name again.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>come <span class='pt-highlight'>by</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>1/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 所属专业域为法律/金融/学术/文学' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>visit informally and spontaneously</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>visit</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>We frequently drop by the neighbors' house for a cup of coffee.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>by</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>4/4</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>be or act in accordance with</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>follow</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span><b>Go</b> <b>by</b> this rule and you'll be safe.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>come <span class='pt-highlight'>by</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>2/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [acquire] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>obtain, especially accidentally</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>acquire</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>They decided to <b>come</b> it <b>by</b> right away.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>run <span class='pt-highlight'>by</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [surpass] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>pass by while running</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>surpass</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>We watched children were <b>running</b> <b>by</b>.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>pass <span class='pt-highlight'>by</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [surpass] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>move past</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>surpass, travel</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>A black limousine <b>passed</b> <b>by</b> when she looked out the window.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>He passed his professor in the hall.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>③</span>One line of soldiers surpassed the other.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>stand <span class='pt-highlight'>by</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>1/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [refrain] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>not act or do anything</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>refrain, forbear</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>He just stood by when the police beat up the demonstrators.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>stand <span class='pt-highlight'>by</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>2/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: wait)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>be available or ready for a certain function or service</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>wait</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The situation began to <b>stand</b> <b>by</b> unexpectedly.</div></div></div></td></tr>
