<details class='sub-section' id='sub_12'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>小品词 [FORTH] 核心短语动词 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'></span></span><span class='sub-meta'>22 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>📖 <b>EPE 认知机制 (Lindstromberg Ch.3 §3 & Ch.13 FORTH / FORWARD)：</b>FORTH 与 FORWARD 同源，属正式/文学语域小品词，表示<b>「从内部或静止处向前方、向公众视野迈出或涌现」</b>（如阐述提出 <i>set/put/bring/call forth</i>，出发奔涌 <i>sally/issue/pour forth</i>）。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
