<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Formal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>forth</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>1/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Formal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 文雅/公文小品词 [FORTH]' style='cursor:help;'>🏛️ 正式/书面 (Formal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>come out of</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>issue, emerge</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>Water issued from the hole in the wall.</div></div>
