<details class='sub-section' id='sub_13'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>小品词 [FORWARD] 核心短语动词 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'></span></span><span class='sub-meta'>12 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>📖 <b>EPE 认知机制 (Lindstromberg Ch.3 §3 FORWARD vs ON² & BACK)：</b>FORWARD 强调<b>「主体面朝运动正前方积极推进」</b>，在英语中具有极强的正面价值色彩（<i>look/step/come/put/move/carry/push forward</i>）。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>forward</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [proceed] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>move ahead; travel onward in time or space</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>proceed, continue</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>We proceeded towards Washington.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>She continued in the direction of the hills.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>③</span>We are moving ahead in time now.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>look <span class='pt-highlight'>forward</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [expect] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>expect or hope for</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>expect, await</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>I look to hear from you soon.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>come <span class='pt-highlight'>forward</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>make oneself visible; take action</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>make</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>Young people should step to the fore and help their peers.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>put <span class='pt-highlight'>forward</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>1/4</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [submit] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>put before</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>submit, posit</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>I submit to you that the accused is guilty.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>put <span class='pt-highlight'>forward</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>2/4</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [nominate] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>propose as a candidate for some honor</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>nominate, propose</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>They decided to <b>put</b> it <b>forward</b> right away.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>put <span class='pt-highlight'>forward</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>3/4</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>summon into action or bring into existence, often as if by magic</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>raise, conjure</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>Raise the specter of unemployment.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>He conjured wild birds in the air.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>③</span>Call down the spirits from the mountain.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>put <span class='pt-highlight'>forward</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>4/4</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [assert] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>insist on having one's opinions and rights recognized</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>assert, behave</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>Women should assert themselves more!</div></div></div></td></tr>
