<details class='sub-section' id='sub_14'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>小品词 [FOR] 核心短语动词 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'></span></span><span class='sub-meta'>44 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>📖 <b>EPE 认知机制 (Lindstromberg Ch.19 FOR: To, of)：</b>FOR 源于古英语 <i>fore</i>（在…之前），在现代英语中丧失了纯空间图像，专职表达<b>「目的与意图目标 (Purpose & Intended Recipient)」、「心理指向与追求 (Aiming & Longing for)」、「代表与支持 (Support)」以及「交换与替代 (Exchange & Substitution)」</b>。因此，追寻某物用 <i>look/search/ask/go/shoot for</i>，代表或支持某方用 <i>stand/speak/root/care for</i>。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>make <span class='pt-highlight'>for</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: wreak)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>cause to happen or to occur as a consequence</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>wreak, create</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>I cannot work a miracle.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>Wreak havoc.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>③</span>Bring comments.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>look <span class='pt-highlight'>for</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>1/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [search] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>try to locate or discover, or try to establish the existence of</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>search, seek</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>The police are searching for clues.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>They are searching for the missing man in the entire county.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>call <span class='pt-highlight'>for</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>1/4</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [request] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>express the need or desire for; ask for</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>request, bespeak</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>She requested an extra bed in her room.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>She <b>called</b> <b>for</b> room service.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>call <span class='pt-highlight'>for</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>2/4</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [necessitate] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>require as useful, just, or proper</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>necessitate, ask</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>It takes nerve to do what she did.</div></div>
