<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>③</span>This job asks a lot of patience and skill.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>account <span class='pt-highlight'>for</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>1/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库学术/公文分布比高 (2.584x)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>be the reason or explanation for</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>be</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The recession <b>accounts</b> <b>for</b> the slow retail business.</div></div></div></td></tr>
