<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>account <span class='pt-highlight'>for</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>2/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库学术/公文分布比高 (2.584x) + 作为正式词 [explain] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>give reasons for</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>explain, explicate</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>Can you <b>account</b> <b>for</b> all these absences?</div></div></div></td></tr>
