<details class='sub-section' id='sub_15'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>小品词 [FROM] 核心短语动词 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'></span></span><span class='sub-meta'>4 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>📖 <b>EPE 认知机制 (Lindstromberg Ch.2 §9 FROM vs OFF/OF)：</b>FROM 描述<b>「路径的起点或源头 (Origin: ●→)」</b>，且暗示转化前后的显著差异距离（Figure 2.6 <i>vinegar made from apple juice</i>）。在短语动词中主要体现两大图式：① <b>源自与衍生</b>（<i>stem/spring/arise/derive/issue/result from</i>）；② <b>分离与阻止（`NOT →` 逻辑，Ch.2 §9.2.3）</b>：把主体拉开使其不接触某行为（<i>keep/stop/prevent/refrain/abstain/detract from</i>）。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>date <span class='pt-highlight'>from</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [originate] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>belong to an earlier time</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>originate, initiate</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>This story dates back 200 years.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Formal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>escape <span class='pt-highlight'>from</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Formal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：拉丁/法语学术词根 [escape] + 书面介词搭配 [from]' style='cursor:help;'>🏛️ 正式/书面 (Formal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>get rid of</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>shake, escape</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>I couldn't shake the car that was following me.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>flow <span class='pt-highlight'>from</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库学术/公文分布比高 (3.789x) + 作为正式词 [result] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>be the result of</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>result, ensue</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>We need to <b>flow</b> <b>from</b> this with great care.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>shrink <span class='pt-highlight'>from</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 书面介词搭配 [from]' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>avoid (one's assigned duties)</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>fiddle, shirk</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The derelict soldier shirked his duties.</div></div></div></td></tr>
