<details class='sub-section' id='sub_38'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>小品词 [TO] 核心短语动词 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'></span></span><span class='sub-meta'>38 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>📖 <b>EPE 认知机制 (Lindstromberg Ch.2 §3 & Ch.20 TO: With, for, against)：</b>TO 指向<b>「路径的终点或接收者 (Endpoint of a path / Recipient: →●)」</b>，与 FROM 严格对立。在短语动词中，它表达：① <b>方向抵达与意识恢复</b>（<i>come to</i> 意识回到常态终点，<i>get/set to</i> 着手干）；② <b>紧密依附、顺从与坚持</b>（<i>stick/adhere/cling/conform/bow/submit to</i>）；③ <b>引发或诉诸某结果</b>（<i>lead/amount/resort/see to</i>）。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>to</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [attend] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>be present at (meetings, church services, university), etc.</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>attend</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>She attends class regularly.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>I rarely attend services at my church.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>③</span>Did you <b>go</b> <b>to</b> the meeting?</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>to</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>1/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [reach] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>reach a goal, e.g.,</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>reach, achieve</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>Make the first team.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>We made it!</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>③</span>She may not make the grade.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>come <span class='pt-highlight'>to</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>1/4</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>cause to experience suddenly</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>hit, strike</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>Panic struck me.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>An interesting idea hit her.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>③</span>A thought came to me.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>to</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>2/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>arrive at the point of</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>begin, start</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>She <b>gets</b> <b>to</b> fretting if I stay away from home too long.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>to</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>3/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>cause annoyance in; disturb, especially by minor irritations</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>annoy, rag</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>Mosquitoes buzzing in my ear really bothers me.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>It irritates me that she never closes the door after she leaves.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>turn <span class='pt-highlight'>to</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>1/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [address] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>speak to</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>address, communicate</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>He addressed the crowd outside the window.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>to</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>1/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>have a fancy or particular liking or desire for</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>fancy, desire</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>She fancied a necklace that she had seen in the jeweler's window.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>look <span class='pt-highlight'>to</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>1/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [expect] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>turn one's interests or expectations towards</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>expect, await</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span><b>Look</b> <b>to</b> the future.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>This method <b>looks</b> <b>to</b> significant wavings.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>come <span class='pt-highlight'>to</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>2/4</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>attain</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>strike, achieve</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The horse finally struck a pace.</div></div></div></td></tr>
