<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Formal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>conform <span class='pt-highlight'>to</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>1/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Formal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库学术/公文分布比高 (1.809x) + 拉丁/法语学术词根 [conform]' style='cursor:help;'>🏛️ 正式/书面 (Formal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>satisfy a condition or restriction</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>meet, fit</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>Does this paper meet the requirements for the degree?</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Formal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>attach <span class='pt-highlight'>to</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>2/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Formal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：拉丁/法语学术词根 [attach] + 书面介词搭配 [to]' style='cursor:help;'>🏛️ 正式/书面 (Formal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>be part of</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>include</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>This problem inheres in the design.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Formal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>conform <span class='pt-highlight'>to</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>2/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Formal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库学术/公文分布比高 (1.809x) + 拉丁/法语学术词根 [conform]' style='cursor:help;'>🏛️ 正式/书面 (Formal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>observe</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>comply, follow</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span><b>Conform</b> <b>to</b> the rules.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Formal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>conform <span class='pt-highlight'>to</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>3/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Formal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库学术/公文分布比高 (1.809x) + 拉丁/法语学术词根 [conform]' style='cursor:help;'>🏛️ 正式/书面 (Formal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>behave in accordance or in agreement with</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>follow, imitate</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>Follow a pattern.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>Follow my example.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>stoop <span class='pt-highlight'>to</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [patronize] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>make concessions to</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>patronize, patronise</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>We need to <b>stoop</b> <b>to</b> this with great care.</div></div></div></td></tr>
</table></details>
<details class='sub-section' id='sub_39'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>小品词 [TROUBLE] 核心短语动词 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'></span></span><span class='sub-meta'>1 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>📖 <b>EPE 认知机制：</b>核心小品词空间与隐喻延伸用法。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>ask <span class='pt-highlight'>for trouble</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + adv. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [persevere] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>persist with actions or an attitude despite the probability that it will cause trouble</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>persevere, persist</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>He is <b>asking</b> for <b>trouble</b> with his behavior.</div></div></div></td></tr>
</table></details>
<details class='sub-section' id='sub_40'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>小品词 [UNDER] 核心短语动词 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'></span></span><span class='sub-meta'>8 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>📖 <b>EPE 认知机制 (Lindstromberg Ch.3 §6 Fig.3.7 & Ch.12 UNDER, BELOW)：</b>UNDER 表示处于参照物正下方，在隐喻中固定对应<b>「承受重压、被支配制服或沉没于水平面以下」</b>（如屈服认输 <i>buckle/knuckle under</i>，破产倒闭沉没 <i>go under</i>）。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>under</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>1/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>go under,</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>sink, settle</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The raft sank and its occupants drowned.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>under</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>2/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>be called; go by a certain name</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>be</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>She goes by her maiden name again.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>under</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>3/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [descend] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>disappear beyond the horizon</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>descend</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The sun sets early these days.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>put <span class='pt-highlight'>under</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [anesthetize] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>administer an anesthetic drug to</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>anesthetize, anaesthetize</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>The patient must be anesthetized before the operation.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>Anesthetize the gum before extracting the teeth.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>fall <span class='pt-highlight'>under</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [constitute] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>be included in or classified as</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>constitute, represent</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>This <b>falls</b> <b>under</b> the rubric 'various'.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>bob <span class='pt-highlight'>under</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [vanish] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>disappear suddenly, as if under the surface of a body of water</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>vanish, disappear</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The situation began to <b>bob</b> <b>under</b> unexpectedly.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>buckle <span class='pt-highlight'>under</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>consent reluctantly</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>yield, succumb</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The situation began to <b>buckle</b> <b>under</b> unexpectedly.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>knuckle <span class='pt-highlight'>under</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>consent reluctantly</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>yield, succumb</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The situation began to <b>knuckle</b> <b>under</b> unexpectedly.</div></div></div></td></tr>
</table></details>
<details class='sub-section' id='sub_41'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>小品词 [WAR] 核心短语动词 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'></span></span><span class='sub-meta'>1 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>📖 <b>EPE 认知机制：</b>核心小品词空间与隐喻延伸用法。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>to war</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + adv. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>commence hostilities</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>war</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>We need to <b>go</b> to <b>war</b> this with great care.</div></div></div></td></tr>
</table></details>
<details class='sub-section' id='sub_42'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>小品词 [WITH] 核心短语动词 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'></span></span><span class='sub-meta'>22 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>📖 <b>EPE 认知机制 (Lindstromberg Ch.18 WITH: For, to, without, together, apart)：</b>WITH 在古英语中曾表“对抗（against）”（残留在 <i>withstand, fight/quarrel/argue/tangle with</i> 中），后吸收了北欧语源的<b>「伴随、同在、合作与工具属性 (Accompaniment, Cooperation & Instrument)」</b>（如 <i>agree/comply/side/team up/deal with</i>，以及利用某物或告别某物 <i>do away/dispense/part with</i>）。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>with</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [accompany] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>be present or associated with an event or entity</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>accompany</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>French fries come with the hamburger.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>Heart attacks are accompanied by distruction of heart tissue.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>③</span>Fish usually <b>goes</b> <b>with</b> white wine.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>along with</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + adv. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [relate] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>have smooth relations</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>relate</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>My boss and I get along very well.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>hitched with</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + adv. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>take in marriage</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>marry, wed</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>We need to <b>get</b> hitched <b>with</b> this with great care.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>come <span class='pt-highlight'>with</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [accompany] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>be present or associated with an event or entity</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>accompany</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>French fries <b>come</b> <b>with</b> the hamburger.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>Heart attacks are accompanied by distruction of heart tissue.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>③</span>Fish usually goes with white wine.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>part <span class='pt-highlight'>with</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库学术/公文分布比高 (1.654x)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>give up what is not strictly needed</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>spare</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>He asked if they could spare one of their horses to speed his journey.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>live <span class='pt-highlight'>with</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [accept] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>tolerate or accommodate oneself to</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>accept, swallow</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>I shall have to accept these unpleasant working conditions.</div></div>
